# ============================================================
# plan: tvac -- manual chamber operation
# ============================================================
# Loads the routines that own the chamber and the bench instruments, records
# every variable, and runs until ctrl `end`. Operate from the console's cast
# tab: `help` lists every command (hvc ..., psu1 ..., status tc, ...).
#
#   ctrl> run tvac      ...   cast> hvc platen 25   ...   ctrl> end
#
# On `end` each routine's rShutdown runs: rPSU turns off channels this run
# switched on, rLACO ends pumping this run started, ports are released.
#
# Another computer, or this one with the chamber unreachable: put a copy with
# a different `load` line in a folder named by $FORMSLAB_PLANS_DIR (searched
# before this checkout), e.g. without rLACO.

load rCryoBoard rLACO rOrbit rPSU rSLTA rSMTC08
record every 30 s

log manual operation: use the cast tab; ctrl `end` to stop
hold until end
